{%- comment -%}
The IG's Releases page: the binary assets each GitHub release carries, as links.
Reads `site.data.ig_releases`: `repository`, `read_at`, and `releases[]`
(`tag`, `name`, `url`, `published`, `prerelease`, `assets[]` with `name`, `url`,
`size`, `digest`). Every value is computed by `releaseVariables` in
`build-ig-site.ts` from `fhir-artifact-index/releases.json` (`ig-releases/v1`);
this file only arranges them. The bytes are never on this site: previews and
pages carry no binaries, releases do (bean `b8ip`).
{%- endcomment -%}
